[PrintTextModified Text:那天早晨，艾玛难得地感觉精神焕发。|#0103Adv04_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（好像退烧了……！<br>　身体比平时轻松多了）|#0103Adv04_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛立刻给雪莉、汉娜和梅露露<br>发送消息。|#0103Adv04_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『我病已经好了！』|#0103Adv04_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:『今天终于可以去野餐了！』|#0103Adv04_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:三人很快就回复了同意，<br>艾玛带着笑容走向过道。|#0103Adv04_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

