[PrintTextModified Text:啊，艾玛小姐。早上好。<br>太好了，你终于康复了……|#0103Adv04_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露早上好！<br>让大家这么担心真是对不起。|#0103Adv04_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你这是要去吃早餐吗？|#0103Adv04_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，不是的。既然决定要野餐了，<br>我正要去医务室准备便当……|#0103Adv04_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？能在医务室做便当吗？|#0103Adv04_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我还以为是<br>要把食堂的那个装进篮子里呢。|#0103Adv04_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:那个……监牢外面长着很多野草和香草……<br>我已经采集了一些。|#0103Adv04_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果去森林那边，还能找到蘑菇和野果。<br>不过采蘑菇的时候要特别小心……|#0103Adv04_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……！之前我都不知道……！|#0103Adv04_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我觉得<br>如果总是吃食堂的东西会很单调。|#0103Adv04_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我希望能让大家露出哪怕一点笑容。<br>这是我唯一能做到的事了……|#0103Adv04_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露真是温柔啊……|#0103Adv04_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Flushed

[PrintTextModified Text:听到艾玛的夸奖，梅露露害羞地脸红了，<br>但很快又露出忧虑的神色。|#0103Adv04_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香小姐应该也是靠这些食物<br>维持生活吧……|#0103Adv04_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我很担心<br>她会不会挨饿……|#0103Adv04_Meruru008| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（是啊……奈叶香还是下落不明……<br>　为什么一直找不到她呢？）|#0103Adv04_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一直在外面生活，一定很辛苦吧……|#0103Adv04_Meruru009| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们也得继续寻找奈叶香。<br>要是她已经成功越狱就好了……|#0103Adv04_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm
