[PrintTextModified Text:走进医务室时——里面已经有人在了。|#0103Adv04_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_35_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙正蹲在药品柜前翻找着什么，<br>各种药瓶散落在她的脚边。|#0103Adv04_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised

; ＠備考◆はっと息を呑む

[PrintTextModified Text:！|#0103Adv04_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:发现艾玛和梅露露进来，<br>亚里沙浑身僵硬，一脸尴尬。|#0103Adv04_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:7_2 SubId:Middle

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙……你这是在做什么……？|#0103Adv04_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:关你什么事！！|#0103Adv04_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然态度强硬，<br>但亚里沙还是大步朝梅露露走去。|#0103Adv04_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL2 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:冰上——那个东西在哪里？|#0103Adv04_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（那个东西……？）|#0103Adv04_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……不、不能给你……|#0103Adv04_Meruru010| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,ArmL1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊？！你是想违抗我吗！！|#0103Adv04_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,ArmL7 SubId:Front
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Alisa-Front Loop:false ScenePositionX:55


[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙抓住梅露露的衣领威胁道。<br>她的样子看起来异常急切。|#0103Adv04_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,ArmL7 SubId:Front
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1,ArmR1,ArmL13 SubId:Front
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:虽、虽然不知道发生了什么，<br>但请不要使用暴力！！|#0103Adv04_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,ArmL1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:啧……|#0103Adv04_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Alisa-Front Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙猛地松开梅露露，<br>快步逃离了医务室。|#0103Adv04_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:咳咳……咳咳咳……|#0103Adv04_Meruru011| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露，你没事吧！？|#0103Adv04_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛轻抚着跪倒在地上的梅露露的背。<br>梅露露的眉头紧锁，露出悲伤的表情。|#0103Adv04_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露，那个……<br>亚里沙是不是和你起了什么冲突……？|#0103Adv04_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露犹豫了一会，<br>终于缓缓开口。|#0103Adv04_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……刚被关进来的时候，<br>亚里沙小姐说她睡不着觉。|#0103Adv04_Meruru012| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:因为药品柜里有镇定剂和安眠药，<br>我就给了她一些……<br>但是亚里沙小姐似乎有过量服药的情况……|#0103Adv04_Meruru013| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:过量用药……这样很危险呢……|#0103Adv04_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是的。她很快就把药吃完了，<br>然后不断索要更多……<br>这样对身体会造成很大伤害。|#0103Adv04_Meruru014| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我真是太轻率了……！<br>看到亚里沙小姐那么痛苦，我就……|#0103Adv04_Meruru015| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的脸因悲伤而扭曲，似乎随时都要哭出来。|#0103Adv04_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我无法辩解……<br>我就是个帮凶……|#0103Adv04_Meruru016| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别、别那么自责啦！<br>你也只是出于关心亚里沙才给她药，<br>而且亚里沙现在不是还好好的吗。|#0103Adv04_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是的……目前还没有出现不良反应……<br>但是，以后会怎样谁也说不准……|#0103Adv04_Meruru017| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露摇摇晃晃地站起身，<br>走向病床。|#0103Adv04_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从床单的缝隙中，<br>小心翼翼地取出一瓶药。|#0103Adv04_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; アイテム表示：『睡眠薬』
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:4-3

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:这就是亚里沙小姐一直在找的安眠药。|#0103Adv04_Meruru018| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为效果特别好，<br>所以变成了亚里沙小姐最依赖的东西。|#0103Adv04_Meruru019| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我把这个药藏了起来，<br>告诉她暂时不能再给她这种药了……|#0103Adv04_Meruru020| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我本来没打算一直藏着的，<br>准备过段时间再给她……|#0103Adv04_Meruru021| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true
[PrintTextModified Text:（原来是这样……）|#0103Adv04_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……梅露露，我们来准备野餐的便当吧！<br>需要我帮什么忙吗？|#0103Adv04_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:看到梅露露一副自责的样子，<br>艾玛试图用开朗的语气给她打气。<br>梅露露这才终于露出一丝微笑。|#0103Adv04_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:说得对呢……今天是野餐日呢。<br>让我们做一个能让大家开心的便当吧……！|#0103Adv04_Meruru022| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯！|#0103Adv04_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我去准备食材，<br>那个……|#0103Adv04_Meruru023| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐，<br>你能帮忙整理一下这些药品吗……？|#0103Adv04_Meruru024| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:当然可以！|#0103Adv04_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛开始捡起散落在药品柜前的药瓶。|#0103Adv04_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然之前没仔细看过这里，<br>　但真是有好多药啊……）|#0103Adv04_Ema021|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然有些药品的用途显而易见，<br>但也有许多药品的用途完全不明。|#0103Adv04_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

